powerpagecomponent.content:
{
  "display_name": "Footer",
  "type": 756150001,
  "value": "{% comment %}
  The logo URL is read from the same 'Logo URL' snippet the header uses, so the
  address is defined in one place and a brand change reaches both marks.

  alt is deliberately empty and the mark is not a link: the header logo already
  announces Ascot Lloyd and already links home, so repeating either here would
  give screen reader and keyboard users a duplicate they have to step past.
{% endcomment %}
{% if snippets['Logo URL'] %}
  <img class="ot-footer__logo" src="{{ snippets['Logo URL'] }}" alt="" aria-hidden="true">
{% endif %}
<p class="smallText">Copyright © {{ now | date: 'yyyy' }}. All rights reserved.</p>"
}
